@startuml
title Varan MIS - System Context

actor Admin
actor Registrar
actor Viewer

rectangle "User Browser" as Browser
rectangle "Varan MIS Django App" as App
database "SQLite Database" as DB
cloud "Linux VPS\nNginx + systemd + HTTPS" as VPS
rectangle "GitHub Repository" as GitHub

Admin --> Browser : manage master data\nview reports
Registrar --> Browser : register/edit/delete reports
Viewer --> Browser : view dashboard/reports
Browser --> App : HTTP/HTTPS requests
App --> DB : ORM read/write
VPS --> App : reverse proxy to app service
GitHub --> VPS : deploy source by pull/copy
GitHub --> Browser : project documentation

note right of App
Server-rendered Django app.
No public JSON API exists yet.
end note

@enduml
